# SceneView — agent rules

The canonical rules live in **[AGENTS.md](./AGENTS.md)** at the repo root. Read that file.

Windsurf reads `AGENTS.md` natively; `.windsurfrules` is kept only so an older build is
not left with nothing. It is deliberately a pointer and not a copy —
three hand-maintained rules files drifted apart and shipped a dependency 30 minor
versions stale, which is the whole reason this one no longer carries content.
